# promise: #566
# ⌘W on the open pinned tab (Close and Keep Pinned) unloads it and takes it back to its pinned
# page; ⇧⌘T right after brings it back at the page it had gone on to, with its back list (h2), and
# before the Today tab archived ahead of it. ⇧⌘T again brings that one back. Arc 1.173.1 does the
# same (docs/arc-reverse-engineering.md, "Restore Last Closed Tab after Close and Keep Pinned").
# The order is ReopenClosedTab (CraCore); the store's half is StoreTests.reopenClosedPinnedTabs.
budget rss=600 stalls50=8
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=today
wait 3
cra://action/closeTab
wait 1
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=home
wait 3
cra://action/pinTab
wait 1
cra://debug?cdp=Runtime.evaluate&params={"expression":"location.search='?n=away'"}
wait 3
cra://action/closeTab
wait 2
cra://action/reopenClosedTab
wait 3
cra://debug?cdp=Runtime.evaluate&params={"expression":"'page:'+location.search+' h'+history.length"}
expect-log Cra cdp Runtime.evaluate .*"value":"page:\?n=away h2"
cra://action/reopenClosedTab
wait 3
cra://debug?cdp=Runtime.evaluate&params={"expression":"'page:'+location.search+' h'+history.length"}
expect-log Cra cdp Runtime.evaluate .*"value":"page:\?n=today h1"
